F-9E86-4DFC-9DFD-7202F7E9662A}" /></Hides></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Tc3_Vision">ETcVnCameraState</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Specifies the state of a camera controller, which controls an attached camera. ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BaseType>DINT</BaseType><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_ERROR</Text><Enum>-1</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is in an error state (e.g. the connection to the camera was lost). ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_INITIAL</Text><Enum>0</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is in the initial state and ready to establish the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_INITIALIZING</Text><Enum>1</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is initializing the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_INITIALIZED</Text><Enum>2</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller has initialized the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_OPENING</Text><Enum>3</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is establishing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_OPENED</Text><Enum>4</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The connection to the camera has been established and the camera controller is ready to start the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STARTACQUISITION</Text><Enum>5</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is starting the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_ACQUIRING</Text><Enum>6</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera is sending images (either streaming or manually triggered, depending on the configuration). ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STOPACQUISITION</Text><Enum>7</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is stopping the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_RESETTINGFEATURES</Text><Enum>8</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is resetting the features on the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_TRIGGERING</Text><Enum>9</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is processing a softwaretrigger. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_CLOSING</Text><Enum>10</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is closing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>Namespace</Name><Value>Tc3_Vision</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{DD112102-C23A-4B37-A43A-A96400B57010}" Namespace="VN">TcVnArray8_LREAL</Name><Comment><![CDATA[Eight-dimensional array of element-type LREAL.]]></Comment><BitSize>512</BitSize><BaseType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-00000000000E}">LREAL</BaseType><ArrayInfo><LBound>0</LBound><Elements>8</Elements></ArrayInfo></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{E157680C-3577-4579-BB71-A51E5EBFDD63}">GVSP_PIXEL_FORMAT</Name><Comment><![CDATA[Shows the GVSP (GigE Vision Streaming Protocol) pixel format.]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Color</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000001}">BYTE</Type><Comment><![CDATA[Indicates if the pixel format is mono or color.]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>EffectivePixelSize</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000001}">BYTE</Type><Comment><![CDATA[Effective pixel size in bit]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>8</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Id</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000005}">UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[GVSP pixel format ID]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>16</BitOffs></SubItem><Hides><Hide GUID="{C823D4AE-514B-42EC-B8B1-32180E8DD514}" /></Hides></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{3642C447-4E03-46B5-B473-41DEC5A58EC3}">GVSP_LEADER_PAYLOAD_IMAGE</Name><Comment><![CDATA[Shows information over the GVSP (GigE Vision Streaming Protocol) leader payload image.]]></Comment><BitSize>256</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Timestamp</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-00000000000B}">ULINT</Type><C